"stat"><strong>Wood fire</strong><span>working insert in the living room</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>10–15 min walk</strong><span>to the estuary beach</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="why"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">More than a golf trip</span><h2>A week to enjoy together.</h2></div><p>Play in the morning, walk by the Atlantic in the afternoon, share seafood and wine in El Rompido, then finish the evening around the fireplace or on the terrace beneath the pines.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="number">01</span><h3>A private house</h3><p>Five bedrooms, several living spaces, a secluded garden, a private pool and complete freedom from hotel schedules.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Several courses</h3><p>Use Golf Nuevo Portil as the local anchor, then vary the stay with El Rompido, Islantilla or Isla Canela.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Andalusian evenings</h3><p>Cook together, use the barbecue, walk to restaurants or settle around the fire on cooler nights.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section alt" id="golf"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Green fees and tee times</span><h2>Choose the course. Book the tee time directly.</h2></div><p>Villa Almale provides accommodation only. The official links below let guests check current green fees, availability and equipment directly with each independent golf provider.</p></div><div class="notice-box golf-access" style="margin-bottom:22px"><strong>Golf at the doorstep.</strong> The official pedestrian access to Golf Nuevo Portil is beside the residential entrance and is reached in under one minute on foot. The small private gate on the property boundary is not a guest entrance.</div><div class="course-grid">
<article class="course-card"><span class="kicker">Golf Nuevo Portil</span><h3>Golf Nuevo Portil</h3><p>The local reference: an 18-hole, par-71 course through the pine landscape, close enough to reach on foot.</p><p>{ext_link(LINKS['nuevo_book'], 'Book a tee time →')}<br/>{ext_link(LINKS['nuevo_rates'], 'View official green fees →')}</p></article>
<article class="course-card"><span class="kicker">Golf El Rompido</span><h3>North &amp; South courses</h3><p>Two distinct courses provide 36 holes in the natural setting of the Río Piedras marshlands.</p><p>{ext_link(LINKS['rompido_book'], 'Book a tee time →')}<br/>{ext_link(LINKS['rompido_rates'], 'View official green fees →')}</p></article>
<article class="course-card"><span class="kicker">Islantilla Golf Resort</span><h3>Three nine-hole loops</h3><p>A 27-hole option with different 18-hole combinations and an established golf academy.</p><p>{ext_link(LINKS['islantilla_book'], 'Book a tee time →')}<br/>{ext_link(LINKS['islantilla_info'], 'Course and official rates →')}</p></article>
<article class="course-card"><span class="kicker">Isla Canela Golf</span><h3>Old Course &amp; Links</h3><p>Two complementary 18-hole courses near the Guadiana, close to the Portuguese border.</p><p>{ext_link(LINKS['isla_canela'], 'Official golf website and booking →')}</p></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="house"><div class="shell two-col"><div class="house-photo"><img alt="Villa ALMALE living room open to the garden" decoding="async" height="1080" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/current/salon-ouvert-jardin.webp" width="1440"/></div><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">The house as a shared base</span><h2>Five bedrooms. One place to come home to.</h2><p>Villa Almale can host up to 10 guests, with a maximum of six adults. For a six-golfer stay, the five bedrooms allow four individual rooms and one shared twin room, while the garage keeps equipment out of the living spaces.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>3 double bedrooms + 2 twin bedrooms</li><li>Secure garage storage for golf bags, trolleys and bicycles</li><li>Large indoor and outdoor dining tables for 10</li><li>Equipped kitchen, gas barbecue and fibre internet</li><li>Working wood-burning fireplace insert, with firewood in the garage</li><li>Private fenced saltwater pool and secluded garden</li></ul><div class="button-row"><a class="button secondary" href="{TARGET['en']}">Explore the full house →</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Between Seville and the Algarve</span><h2>Golf finishes. The holiday continues.</h2></div><p>Villa Almale is for groups who value the hours after the round as much as the scorecard: Atlantic walks, fresh seafood, long tables, El Rompido and unhurried Andalusian evenings.</p></div><div class="timeline"><article><time>Morning</time><h3>Tee time</h3><p>Breakfast together, then walk to Nuevo Portil or drive to another course.</p></article><article><time>Afternoon</time><h3>Atlantic coast</h3><p>Beach, garden, El Rompido or a slower day for non-golfers.</p></article><article><time>Evening</time><h3>A shared table</h3><p>Cook, barbecue or choose a local seafood restaurant.</p></article><article><time>Cooler nights</time><h3>By the fire</h3><p>Return to the living-room fireplace and a final glass together.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section alt" id="practical"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Plan the stay</span><h2>Accommodation, tee times and transport — clearly separated.</h2></div></div><div class="rich-grid"><article class="info-panel span-6"><span class="kicker">01</span><h3>Accommodation only</h3><p>The villa rate does not include flights, green fees, golf equipment, car hire or transfers. This keeps every group free to build its own programme.</p></article><article class="info-panel span-6"><span class="kicker">02</span><h3>Short off-season stays</h3><p>Selected off-season dates are offered from four nights. Live availability and the applicable minimum stay appear on the direct booking page.</p></article><article class="info-panel span-6"><span class="kicker">03</span><h3>Airport &amp; golf transfers</h3><p>An independent local operator offers private transfers from Faro and Seville airports and journeys to the main golf courses in the area.</p><p>{ext_link(LINKS['transfer'], 'Request an independent transfer quote →', 'transfer_click')}</p></article><article class="info-panel span-6"><span class="kicker">04</span><h3>Seasonal comfort</h3><p>The working wood-burning insert warms the living room and firewood is stored in the garage. The house is not centrally heated or fully air-conditioned; three portable AC units and ceiling fans support comfort in selected rooms.</p></article></div><div class="notice-box" style="margin-top:22px"><strong>Independent services.</strong> Golf clubs and the transfer operator set their own prices, availability, conditions and payment terms. Their inclusion here is practical information, not a package or endorsement.</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell two-col reverse"><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Common questions</span><h2>A clear offer before you travel.</h2><div class="faq" style="margin-top:28px">{faq_html('en')}</div></div><div class="photo-card"><img alt="Outdoor dining in the Andalusian patio at Villa ALMALE" decoding="async" height="1080" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/current/patio-andalou-table-dressee.webp" width="1440"/><div class="photo-copy"><h3>Golf by day. Andalusia afterwards.</h3><p>Villa ALMALE · Nuevo Portil · VFT/HU/02471</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section-sm"><div class="shell"><div class="banner"><div><span class="eyebrow">Direct booking</span><h2>Plan your Atlantic golf holiday.</h2><p>Check live dates, the full villa price and occupancy rules through OwnerRez. Green fees and transfers remain separate.</p></div><a class="button light" data-analytics-event="booking_click" href="{BOOKING['en']}">Open live availability →</a></div></div></section>
</main>'''


def main_fr() -> str:
    return f'''<main>
<section class="hero hero-season"><div class="shell"><div class="hero-content"><span class="eyebrow">Séjours golf privés sur la côte atlantique espagnole</span><h1>Jouer au golf. Vivre l’Andalousie.</h1><p class="lead">Une maison privée de cinq chambres pour les groupes qui veulent davantage qu’une partie de golf : l’accès officiel au Golf Nuevo Portil est à moins d’une minute à pied, avec l’Atlantique, El Rompido et l’est de l’Algarve facilement accessibles.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" data-analytics-event="booking_click" href="{BOOKING['fr']}">Voir les dates et les prix →</a><a class="button outline-light" href="{HOME['fr']}">Voir le site principal</a></div></div></div><div class="hero-facts"><div class="hero-fact"><strong>5</strong><span>chambres</span></div><div class="hero-fact"><strong>10</strong><span>voyageurs maximum</span></div><div class="hero-fact"><strong>6</strong><span>adultes maximum</span></div><div class="hero-fact"><strong>Privée</strong><span>piscine clôturée</span></div></div></section>
